  m_Name: Remora
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ObjectName: Remora
  Facts:
  - text: "The Ocean Hitchhiker!\nThe remora has a suction pad on top of its head\u2014like
      a natural sticky cup!\nIt uses it to stick to sharks, whales, and turtles,
      getting free rides through the ocean.\nWhile traveling, it eats leftover scraps
      and keeps its host clean.\nIt\u2019s the ultimate ride-share buddy of the sea!"
